flowchart LR
    Garments[Existing clothing IDs and wardrobe rules] --> Wardrobe[Planned WardrobeManager: owned outfit and presets]
    Inventory[Existing backpack and item definitions] --> Economy[EconomyManager: tools and weapon]
    Economy --> Action[Player action controller: active held item]
    Wardrobe --> Snapshot[Immutable visual snapshot]
    Action --> Snapshot
    Clock[IsoChibiSprite2D: clip, direction, frame] --> Presenter[EquipmentVisuals presenter]
    Snapshot --> Presenter
    Art[Per-body fitted layers, sockets and occluders] --> Presenter
    Presenter --> Actor[One actor y-sort subtree]
    Wardrobe --> Save[Existing owner save sections]
    Economy --> Save
